<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in</p>
<p>thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    1811    478    4826    60</p>
<p> Great Lakes    20479  10686    6500    24</p>
<p> River Points   12610  26984   21615    37</p>
<p> Southwest	10769   8803     676    21</p>
<p> Gulf Points     9078   7329    6925    32</p>
<p> Plains Area    28837  28205    2793    38</p>
<p> Pacific NW	9931   2527     unq    40</p>
<p> Grand Total    93515  85012   43335    32</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-983-7278--</p>
